── SYNTAX ERROR ──────────────────────────────── E0100_extension.lt:3:1  [E0100]

Stilt adds methods to a type with `impl`:

  3 │ extension Point {
    │ ^^^^^^^^^

`impl T { … }` adds methods to a type of the same module; a type of another
module gets them through a trait.

To fix it, write `impl`:

  3 │ impl Point {
    │ ~~~~
